From 4d51b7f00504aad60ed5afe9f5d80be5b581b1f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reuben olinsky <reubeno@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:06:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove eMudhra emSign and AAA fallback roots

Remove the eMudhra emSign and AAA Certificate Services fallback records, including their constraints, to enforce Azure Linux's eMudhra certificate exclusion policy.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 x509roots/fallback/bundle.go | 92 ------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 92 deletions(-)

diff --git a/x509roots/fallback/bundle.go b/x509roots/fallback/bundle.go
index 81ad6e8..9e92877 100644
--- a/x509roots/fallback/bundle.go
+++ b/x509roots/fallback/bundle.go
@@ -3877,98 +3877,6 @@ eAyxr87GyZDvvzAEwDAKBggqhkjOPQQDAgNJADBGAiEAtVfd14pVCzbhhkT61Nlo
 jbjcI4qKDdQvfepz7L9NbKgCIQDLpbQS+ue16M9+k/zzNY9vTlp8tLxOsvxyqltZ
 +efcMQ==
 -----END CERTIFICATE-----
